              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umwaka utashe, ku gacikamvura, mu gihe abami bākunda kuja mu ntambara, Yowabu ajana ingabo, aragenda atera igihugu c’Abamoni, ashika n’i Raba, arahaziguza. Ariko Dawidi ubgiwe yisigarira i Yerusalemu. Nuko Yowabu atsinda i Raba, arahasangangura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
